<p>Bawafa Ya Abbas..(2)<br />
{Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi}..(4)</p>

<p>1. Jagah Jagah Hai Alam Gawahi<br />
Dilo'n Pe Teri Hai Badshahi<br />
Labo'n Pe tera Hi Naam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
{Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi}..(2)</p>

<p>2. Tere Alam Ka Hai Ham Pe Saya<br />
Alam Pe Saya Hai Panjetan Ka<br />
Baland Tera Maqam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
Bawafa Ya Abbas..(2)</p>

<p>3. Alam Ka Jab Se Hua Hay Saya<br />
Zameen-e-Karb-o-Bala Pe Moula<br />
Tera Hai Chalta Nizam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
{Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi }..(2)</p>

<p>4. Tu Bawafa Hai Tu Lafata Hai<br />
Be aasro'n Ka Tu Aasra Hai<br />
Jahan Main Charcha Hai Aam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
Bawafa Ya Abbas..(2)</p>

<p>5. Hussain Moula Se Pyaar Karna<br />
Hussain Per Jaa'n Nisaar Karna<br />
Yehi Hai Tera Payaam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
{Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi }..(2)</p>

<p>6. Jo Tere Bazoo Qalam Na Hote<br />
Aseer Ahl-e-Haram Na Hote<br />
Na Jati Zainab Yu Shaam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
Bawafa Ya Abbas..(2)</p>

<p>7. Ghulam Sharminda Hai ye Moula<br />
Na Laasha Khaimo'n Main Leke Jana<br />
Tha Lab Pe Tere Kalam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
{Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi }..(2)</p>

<p>8. Jawad O Sarwar Jab Aaye Sarwar<br />
Bureeda Bazoo Tha Ibn-e-Haider<br />
To Kaise Karta Salam Ghazi<br />
Wafa Ka Tu Hai Imam Ghazi<br />
Salam Ghazi Salam Ghazi<br />
